17
00:00:33.817 --> 00:00:35.500
"The Plant-Based Athlete,"

18
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.590
which is essentially the ultimate guide

19
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:41.440
to maxing out peak performance the plant-based way,

20
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.760
which is a drum I think you guys know at this point,

21
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.630
I have been beating for many, many years.

22
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.790
If you're a day one fan,

23
00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:48.780
then you remember Matt

24
00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.350
from way back on the show, Episode 54.

25
00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:54.280
He's a plant-based marathoner, ultra runner,

26
00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.700
and the man behind the nomeatathlete.com,

27
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.170
community, books and podcast.

28
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.660
Robert is a former champion vegan bodybuilder,

29
00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:03.730
public speaker.

30
00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.380
He's the Founder of Vegan Bodybuilding &amp; Fitness,

31
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.290
and just a super solid dude

32
00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.730
who's been absolutely crushing it on nothing but plants

33
00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:13.730
for more than 25 years.

34
00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:17.410
This is a fun, super informative, plant-fueled mind meld

35
00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.080
that I have no doubt will leave you empowered

36
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.700
to upgrade your daily plate and crushing your fitness goals.

37
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.260
So, please hit that subscribe button, and here we go.

38
