vegan plant-based athlete dude

99
00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.210
who's been banging the drum for longer than most.

100
00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:43.550
Man, it's been such a DIY thing.

101
00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.970
Doing things I didn't know what I was doing,

102
00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.400
making T-shirts, self-publishing books.

103
00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.640
I was just telling Matt on the way here,

104
00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.197
I put myself on a college campus speaking tour

105
00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:53.447
and was just trying to find my way around to the buildings

106
00:03:53.447 --> 00:03:55.110
to get to the right place.

107
00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.940
Sometimes speaking in front of five people

108
00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.697
that I would spend $700 out of pocket to be there.

109
00:03:58.697 --> 00:04:02.097
Yeah, you're the guy who come out to the parking lot,

110
00:04:02.097 --> 00:04:03.984
