00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.970
Right, so, 2000,

298
00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:35.330
basically like from 2000 through around 2009,

299
00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:38.310
you got into a competition 2006, 2009.

