417
00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:46.640
and that's why I was eating fish too,

418
00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:48.390
'cause I was worried about protein.

419
00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:51.500
What I need to be making sure I'm eating right

420
00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.000
and I kinda started looking around

421
00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.930
and I must've found Robert's site,

422
00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:57.730
