468
00:16:13.188 --> 00:16:14.350
You just got in under the nose.

469
00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:15.183
Is that right?

470
00:16:15.183 --> 00:16:16.810
So, the story has gotten better and better.

471
00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:17.812
It's one of those stories about--

472
00:16:17.812 --> 00:16:18.645
This is a (mumbles).

473
00:16:18.645 --> 00:16:19.478
Right.

474
00:16:19.478 --> 00:16:20.311
Yeah.

475
00:16:20.311 --> 00:16:23.538
So, it was six stabs later that I finally did it.

476
00:16:23.538 --> 00:16:24.390
Wow.

477
00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:25.223
I took off an hour the first time

478
00:16:25.223 --> 00:16:27.276
