491
00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.020
So, 3:10:59 would've done it.

492
00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:56.853
So, I qualified by a minute.

493
00:16:56.853 --> 00:16:57.959
It's a better story.

494
00:16:57.959 --> 00:16:58.792
It's so much better.

495
00:16:58.792 --> 00:16:59.625
(laughs)

496
00:16:59.625 --> 00:17:04.625
And I like how you were mentored

497
00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.980
