1340
00:47:14.890 --> 00:47:15.850
with more muscle,

1341
00:47:15.850 --> 00:47:19.310
he got faster, he got stronger, but the pain went away.

1342
00:47:19.310 --> 00:47:20.888
The pain just went away

1343
00:47:20.888 --> 00:47:23.330
