00:48:16.242 --> 00:48:19.020
so many people came to this lifestyle

1367
00:48:19.020 --> 00:48:21.720
to reduce inflammation, improve recovery

1368
00:48:21.720 --> 00:48:23.150
and have better results.

1369
00:48:23.150 --> 00:48:24.760
And that's what they did

1370
00:48:24.760 --> 00:48:26.680
and it's so fun to tell those stories.

1371
00:48:26.680 --> 00:48:27.910
There's also stories of people

1372
00:48:27.910 --> 00:48:31.300
who all kinds of problems with addiction

1373
