1439
00:50:58.170 --> 00:50:59.820
because that inflammation

1440
00:50:59.820 --> 00:51:03.710
stunts your body's ability to adapt and grow.

1441
00:51:03.710 --> 00:51:05.540
Yeah, everyone always asks what the mechanism is.

1442
