00:51:39.940 --> 00:51:41.210
much as if you actually do try

1462
00:51:41.210 --> 00:51:43.990
and seek out the foods that that would maximize that,

1463
00:51:43.990 --> 00:51:45.890
it just allows you to get back out there faster

1464
00:51:45.890 --> 00:51:48.350
and be back out there 100% or very close to it,

1465
00:51:48.350 --> 00:51:49.760
rather than every time you come out,

1466
00:51:49.760 --> 00:51:50.593
you're a little bit worse

1467
00:51:50.593 --> 00:51:52.310
so that eventually an injury follows.

