3558
02:03:55.545 --> 02:03:57.960
And we knew that was the approach we wanted to take.

3559
02:03:57.960 --> 02:04:01.180
And especially we had our eyes on Dr. Michael Greger

3560
02:04:01.180 --> 02:04:02.600
