02:04:19.600 --> 02:04:22.180
Brenda Davis, Dr. Klaper.

3568
02:04:22.180 --> 02:04:24.103
So many others, Campbell Esselstyn.

3569
02:04:26.009 --> 02:04:28.900
It felt like that was the right approach to take

3570
02:04:28.900 --> 02:04:29.733
