3593
02:05:17.280 --> 02:05:19.280
and tell a really compelling story

3594
02:05:19.280 --> 02:05:22.080
'cause the plant-based movement is ready for it.

3595
02:05:22.080 --> 02:05:24.080
It's ready for this kind of story.

3596
02:05:24.080 --> 02:05:27.000
In canvassing all the research that went into the book,

3597
02:05:27.000 --> 02:05:29.900
the scientific evidence-based research

3598
02:05:29.900 --> 02:05:34.373
on plant-based diet efficacy in terms of being an athlete,

3599
02:05:35.730 --> 02:05:38.090
obviously, there's some gaps.

3600
02:05:38.090 --> 02:05:39.800
Is there a study that

3601
02:05:40.740 --> 02:05:43.100
when you're doing all this,

3602
02:05:43.100 --> 02:05:44.430
was there ever a moment where you're like,

3603
02:05:44.430 --> 02:05:46.350
