I was a super fan

3656
02:07:32.740 --> 02:07:34.890
going to all the Olympia and all the shows.

3657
02:07:34.890 --> 02:07:37.370
But why now later in my life,

3658
02:07:37.370 --> 02:07:40.950
when I lift recreationally, casually for the enjoyment of it

3659
02:07:40.950 --> 02:07:43.820
and I'm bigger, stronger,

3660
02:07:43.820 --> 02:07:46.360
and in many cases, let's say, look better aesthetically

3661
02:07:46.360 --> 02:07:49.240
